// Template for local signing overrides.
//
// Copy this file to Signing.xcconfig (gitignored) in the same folder and
// uncomment/fill in your team ID to build and run on a physical device:
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
//
// Leave Signing.xcconfig empty (or DEVELOPMENT_TEAM unset) for simulator
// builds — no team is required since CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED is NO by default
// in project.yml.
